WEBVTT

00:01.160 --> 00:04.270
For instance,
even if those arms of yours

00:04.270 --> 00:07.100
Become entwined in chains

00:07.100 --> 00:10.540
For instance,
even if this space we live in

00:10.540 --> 00:14.910
Someday will burn completely down

00:14.910 --> 00:21.040
Keep believing in hope, if nothing else

00:22.320 --> 00:26.580
In the shadows of glimmering stars

00:28.390 --> 00:32.660
There is a world governed by darkness

00:34.460 --> 00:38.960
Just one life that is out there

00:40.470 --> 00:45.740
If you keep it entrapped there,
lonely boy

00:46.540 --> 00:52.310
The reason that we met each other here

00:52.310 --> 00:58.650
Must surely exist

00:58.650 --> 01:01.920
For instance,
even if sorrow takes you

01:01.920 --> 01:04.860
And you're about to collapse under it

01:04.860 --> 01:08.200
For instance,
if my chest can become

01:08.200 --> 01:12.570
A power to hold you and keep you there

01:12.570 --> 01:16.940
I'm sure that even
tomorrow we can survive

01:32.050 --> 01:34.220
Hey, is anything there?

01:34.220 --> 01:36.690
All the pretty clothes are mine!

01:36.690 --> 01:39.190
This is a Mission? I've never seen one.

01:39.190 --> 01:43.670
It was a relay base during
the terraforming days.

01:43.670 --> 01:45.530
But now it's completely dead.

01:45.530 --> 01:47.430
It feels forlorn now.

01:49.340 --> 01:51.670
There seems to be many
things here worth using.

01:52.670 --> 01:54.370
Where's the food?

01:56.210 --> 01:59.650
I'm surprised the captain
remembered this space station.

01:59.650 --> 02:01.120
It's not a space station.

02:01.120 --> 02:03.620
It's officially called a Mission.

02:03.620 --> 02:05.290
Oh?

02:05.290 --> 02:07.360
Enough chit-chat.

02:07.360 --> 02:08.560
Get to work.

02:08.560 --> 02:09.520
Work?

02:09.520 --> 02:12.190
It's just looting as
part of your pirating!

02:12.190 --> 02:15.030
We're just utilizing abandoned assets.

02:15.030 --> 02:17.000
You should give accurate orders.

02:17.000 --> 02:17.990
You're so picky.

02:18.970 --> 02:20.070
What's that?

02:20.070 --> 02:21.130
Wait!

02:22.740 --> 02:23.730
Where'd it go?

02:38.750 --> 02:40.190
What is this thing?

02:44.930 --> 02:46.790
Hibiki, hurry up and save me!

02:47.800 --> 02:48.890
Stop it, Utan.

02:52.630 --> 02:54.300
Are you a man?

02:54.300 --> 02:55.840
You are!

02:55.840 --> 02:57.460
Are you here to save us?

02:59.870 --> 03:00.860
What are you doing?

03:07.250 --> 03:09.050
A woman?

03:09.050 --> 03:10.490
What about it?

03:10.490 --> 03:12.720
It's my policy to never kill women.

03:17.430 --> 03:18.760
Right, right.

03:18.760 --> 03:21.830
Looks like I have
the short end of the stick.

03:21.830 --> 03:23.690
What's this? A man?

03:25.170 --> 03:26.400
Seems that way.

03:26.400 --> 03:28.100
Are you thugs or something?

03:28.100 --> 03:30.140
We prefer to be called pirates.

03:30.140 --> 03:31.510
Oh?

03:31.510 --> 03:33.440
Even that girl over there?

03:33.440 --> 03:34.810
I'm a guy!

03:36.980 --> 03:38.850
That's a good one!

03:38.850 --> 03:40.950
W-What's so funny?

03:40.950 --> 03:42.750
Oh, sorry about that.

03:42.750 --> 03:46.750
You're just so cute, I couldn't
help but think you were a girl.

03:46.750 --> 03:48.490
Damn him...

03:48.490 --> 03:49.790
No! What...

03:49.790 --> 03:51.490
What is this filthy thing?

03:51.490 --> 03:53.760
Let go of me!

03:53.760 --> 03:55.420
Help!

03:57.470 --> 03:59.520
That's enough from you, Utan.

04:01.000 --> 04:04.040
Sheesh, your partner's in a crisis here.

04:04.040 --> 04:05.270
You're so useless.

04:08.340 --> 04:09.330
Damn you!

04:14.880 --> 04:16.210
Wait, damn you!

04:17.520 --> 04:18.510
What's this?

04:29.400 --> 04:31.230
All hands, prepare for battle!

04:36.600 --> 04:38.140
Damn it!

04:38.140 --> 04:39.840
What the hell's going on?

04:39.840 --> 04:42.140
It seems people like
us aren't welcome here.

04:47.550 --> 04:49.320
We're heading out, Utan.

04:49.320 --> 04:50.290
Why?

04:50.290 --> 04:51.910
- Come on, Utan.
- Why?

04:53.390 --> 04:54.490
Everyone, hurry!

04:54.490 --> 04:56.220
Targets confirmed!

04:57.290 --> 05:00.260
We'll destroy them all before
they reach the Nirvana.

05:00.260 --> 05:02.930
Leave the big ones to me!

05:02.930 --> 05:04.330
Hey, where's Mr. Alien?

05:07.140 --> 05:08.740
Damn it, too slow!

05:08.740 --> 05:09.900
Oh, there he is!

05:09.900 --> 05:12.270
Mr. Alien, let's combine!

05:12.270 --> 05:13.170
No way!

05:14.210 --> 05:15.540
Why?

05:15.540 --> 05:16.740
Dita, they're coming!

05:18.210 --> 05:19.440
Damn you!

05:41.200 --> 05:43.730
Not yet, Utan. Just hang on.

05:46.540 --> 05:47.840
I said not yet.

05:50.550 --> 05:51.840
Take that!

05:56.080 --> 05:57.320
Well?

05:57.320 --> 05:58.420
What?

05:58.420 --> 06:00.420
- Let's combine.
- No way!

06:00.420 --> 06:02.620
Mr. Alien!

06:02.620 --> 06:03.930
Let's combine!

06:03.930 --> 06:05.260
Hey, stop that!

06:15.040 --> 06:16.590
I did it! I did it!

06:17.610 --> 06:19.440
Let me do this by myself.

06:19.440 --> 06:20.810
I can't believe this!

06:20.810 --> 06:22.940
Dita, you'll pay for this!

06:23.480 --> 06:25.550
I'll just forget it happened!

06:25.550 --> 06:26.910
Well, let's head out!

06:50.140 --> 06:51.800
Did you see that, Utan?

06:54.980 --> 06:58.750
It looks like we've landed
ourselves a huge treasure.

06:58.750 --> 06:59.740
Whoops.

07:02.820 --> 07:04.120
Hmph.

07:04.120 --> 07:05.790
I guess it's about time.

07:05.790 --> 07:07.220
Utan, go for it.

07:36.820 --> 07:38.020
How bothersome.

07:38.020 --> 07:40.150
All that business gone to waste.

07:40.150 --> 07:41.490
That's my line.

07:41.490 --> 07:45.730
I show you some pity and
I get a damaged engine for it.

07:45.730 --> 07:47.300
What are you gonna do?

07:47.300 --> 07:49.100
Who do you think you're talking to?

07:49.100 --> 07:51.670
We're pirates!

07:51.670 --> 07:53.400
Oh, I see.

07:53.400 --> 07:56.140
Then you don't mind
leaving this behind, do you?

07:56.140 --> 07:58.110
Oh no, we forgot it!

08:00.370 --> 08:03.140
I guess we have no choice.
Come aboard.

08:03.140 --> 08:05.280
All right, it's a deal.

08:05.280 --> 08:07.270
I'll be doing some business there.

08:08.820 --> 08:10.450
Is this all right?

08:10.450 --> 08:12.720
Pyoro is part of our crew as well.

08:12.720 --> 08:13.690
Besides,

08:13.690 --> 08:18.280
if he tries anything funny,
we'll just strip him of everything.

08:27.300 --> 08:30.530
This place is just so full of
beautiful, young ladies.

08:31.540 --> 08:33.140
My name's Rabat.

08:33.140 --> 08:34.180
Nice to meet you.

08:34.180 --> 08:35.010
Here you go.

08:35.980 --> 08:38.350
Here. Nice to meet you two.

08:38.350 --> 08:39.910
Pathetic.

08:39.910 --> 08:41.920
Kissing up to women like that.

08:41.920 --> 08:44.250
- He's a disgrace to all men.
- Oh?

08:44.250 --> 08:45.490
You.

08:45.490 --> 08:47.490
You're that lady with the saber.

08:47.490 --> 08:49.520
Now, as a sign of our meeting...

08:49.520 --> 08:50.530
I don't want it!

08:50.530 --> 08:51.490
Don't be shy.

08:51.490 --> 08:52.790
Are you listening?

08:53.760 --> 08:56.130
What is it, you noisy, little brat?

08:56.130 --> 08:59.290
Men don't show their teeth
easily to others, right?

08:59.800 --> 09:01.100
Like this?

09:02.040 --> 09:03.940
Damn you...

09:03.940 --> 09:05.370
Stop it!

09:06.370 --> 09:08.110
I'll introduce you to the captain.

09:08.110 --> 09:09.210
Follow me.

09:09.210 --> 09:11.350
Yeah, yeah, your wish is my command.

09:11.350 --> 09:13.610
Hey, give Pyoro back to us!

09:13.610 --> 09:16.080
Oh, hey! Wait!

09:16.080 --> 09:18.090
Come on, give it back!

09:18.090 --> 09:20.090
They're prisoners of war.

09:20.090 --> 09:23.490
We're from Mejale,
and the men are from Tarak.

09:24.830 --> 09:25.850
That's why.

09:28.160 --> 09:30.150
Mister, don't catch a cold.

09:32.600 --> 09:35.170
So? What do you want?

09:35.170 --> 09:36.240
Oh, nothing...

09:36.240 --> 09:38.270
Since my engine was damaged,

09:38.270 --> 09:41.410
I want to stay here while I fix it.

09:41.410 --> 09:43.640
And do a little business on the side.

09:45.410 --> 09:46.610
All right.

09:46.610 --> 09:47.580
Damn it!

09:48.550 --> 09:50.620
That guy really pisses me off!

09:50.620 --> 09:51.590
He does.

09:51.590 --> 09:53.090
But he's a little suspicious.

09:53.090 --> 09:54.220
I'm going ahead.

09:54.220 --> 09:56.420
Talking about him makes me sick.

09:56.420 --> 09:57.760
That man...

09:59.130 --> 10:01.560
...knows what men and women are.

10:06.830 --> 10:08.560
Well, examine them yourselves!

10:09.770 --> 10:12.710
I'm proud to say
there's nothing I don't have.

10:12.710 --> 10:14.710
Do you... use all these?

10:14.710 --> 10:15.940
Me?

10:15.940 --> 10:17.510
You've got to be joking.

10:17.510 --> 10:20.780
The universe is made up of men and women.

10:20.780 --> 10:22.580
Men and women?

10:22.580 --> 10:25.070
What planet are you from, Mr. Alien?

10:27.290 --> 10:28.950
The same as you.

10:30.190 --> 10:32.660
Wow, this looks great!

10:32.660 --> 10:34.700
You have great eyes, lady!

10:34.700 --> 10:36.360
Install this in your system,

10:36.360 --> 10:38.400
and improvement will
be an understatement!

10:38.400 --> 10:42.240
Really? I wonder if I can put
this in the Paksis Pragma.

10:42.240 --> 10:44.640
Sure. It's perfect for the Paksis!

10:44.640 --> 10:45.910
Fine, I'll take it!

10:45.910 --> 10:46.870
Thanks!

10:46.870 --> 10:49.710
Since you're the first customer,
it'll be free!

10:49.710 --> 10:50.950
Free?

10:50.950 --> 10:52.780
Yeah, it's a steal!

10:52.780 --> 10:54.020
Become better women!

10:54.020 --> 10:56.680
That way, even if you stand still,
men'll flock to you!

11:00.860 --> 11:01.840
Hey!

11:03.020 --> 11:04.460
Am I pretty?

11:05.890 --> 11:11.200
You know, Missie, until you're as
voluptuous as the other ladies,

11:11.200 --> 11:13.000
I won't feel anything for ya.

11:13.000 --> 11:14.170
Understand?

11:14.170 --> 11:15.240
Ribbit! Ribbit!

11:15.240 --> 11:16.600
How boring.

11:17.610 --> 11:20.940
Call me with the frequency on
this business card in 5 years.

11:21.910 --> 11:24.510
By the way,
I want to ask you something.

11:24.510 --> 11:25.780
What?

11:25.780 --> 11:28.680
Those machines that combine.
What are they?

11:31.150 --> 11:33.820
I was wondering why it's been so quiet.

11:33.820 --> 11:36.050
It's because Dita hasn't been around.

11:37.020 --> 11:39.360
Of course she hasn't, Manager.

11:39.360 --> 11:42.060
We have a fourth alien aboard now!

11:42.060 --> 11:46.000
Young girls these days have
such short attention spans.

11:46.000 --> 11:48.600
I hear he's a guy that's
different from the others.

11:48.600 --> 11:50.760
They say he's really nice to women.

11:55.480 --> 11:57.440
He's got it pretty bad.

12:15.600 --> 12:17.360
Are you looking for something?

12:18.370 --> 12:21.300
It doesn't look like
the ship has any damage.

12:21.300 --> 12:24.070
I was able to do the repairs
faster than I thought.

12:25.040 --> 12:26.370
What do you want from us?

12:26.370 --> 12:28.340
Right to the point, huh?

12:28.340 --> 12:30.540
I'm just doing business.

12:31.550 --> 12:34.380
But before that, how about this?

12:34.380 --> 12:37.440
Why don't we get a little closer?

12:41.760 --> 12:43.420
This scent...

12:43.420 --> 12:44.910
The smell of gunpowder?

12:46.090 --> 12:48.650
Looks like you're not
someone to mess with.

13:02.480 --> 13:04.310
Pai-check!

13:07.050 --> 13:09.420
All right, now it's okay!

13:09.420 --> 13:11.080
- Let's test it out!
- Pyoro!

13:14.660 --> 13:16.790
Wow, it's looking great!

13:16.790 --> 13:18.990
Looks like things are going well.

13:18.990 --> 13:21.760
My merchandise does
exactly what I said, right?

13:22.730 --> 13:24.900
What is this "Paksis"?

13:24.900 --> 13:26.230
Oh, there you are!

13:27.270 --> 13:29.290
Hey, Mr. Storemaster!

13:30.270 --> 13:32.740
Hey, you've already gotten all dressy.

13:32.740 --> 13:34.510
You look loads better now.

13:34.510 --> 13:35.640
You think so?

13:35.640 --> 13:37.710
So? What do you want now?

13:37.710 --> 13:39.680
I can take additional orders.

13:39.680 --> 13:42.920
I want to hear stories.

13:42.920 --> 13:44.650
About space...

13:44.650 --> 13:46.480
About men and women...

13:47.960 --> 13:50.590
You're thinking about that
little boy, aren't you?

13:50.590 --> 13:51.930
It's not that...

13:51.930 --> 13:53.360
All right.

13:53.360 --> 13:56.630
But I want to ask
you something in return.

13:57.330 --> 13:59.800
Something's not right about that man.

13:59.800 --> 14:02.540
He knows what planet we're from.

14:02.540 --> 14:04.540
And what we're up against. Perhaps...

14:04.540 --> 14:06.710
...he's one of the enemy.

14:06.710 --> 14:08.710
The Hermit?

14:08.710 --> 14:10.310
The Hermit forward.

14:10.310 --> 14:13.310
An outsider, one who searches...

14:13.310 --> 14:15.310
An enemy or maybe...

14:17.420 --> 14:19.220
Are you worried about Rabat?

14:20.420 --> 14:21.820
He's...

14:21.820 --> 14:23.080
...a pretty good guy.

14:24.060 --> 14:25.690
Everyone says so.

14:25.690 --> 14:27.360
That he's very kind.

14:27.360 --> 14:29.330
Are you guys all idiots?

14:29.330 --> 14:32.200
He's just a smooth-talking
good-for-nothing!

14:32.200 --> 14:35.000
- Everyone's being fooled!
- Extra!

14:35.000 --> 14:36.770
Do you want to hear it?

14:36.770 --> 14:37.810
Shut up!

14:37.810 --> 14:39.110
Tell me later!

14:39.110 --> 14:40.440
Are you sure?

14:40.440 --> 14:42.500
It's about Dita and Rabat!

14:44.580 --> 14:45.680
No!

14:45.680 --> 14:48.280
That's Mr. Alien's valuable partner!

14:48.280 --> 14:50.250
I just want a small peek.

14:50.250 --> 14:51.240
No!

14:52.390 --> 14:53.350
Move.

14:54.890 --> 14:56.690
That bastard!

14:57.990 --> 14:59.530
Hey, what do you think?

14:59.530 --> 15:02.100
You mean which is
he more worried about?

15:02.100 --> 15:04.030
Yeah, Dita or the Van-type.

15:04.030 --> 15:05.630
Hey, I'll pick that one!

15:05.630 --> 15:07.430
Don't be so hotheaded.

15:07.430 --> 15:09.470
What are you to him, anyways?

15:09.470 --> 15:11.170
What am I?

15:11.170 --> 15:15.340
He doesn't think anything of you at all.

15:15.340 --> 15:19.140
Or rather, he thinks
that all women are enemies.

15:20.410 --> 15:22.710
Now get out of my way.

15:24.020 --> 15:25.080
Let go of her!

15:27.520 --> 15:28.660
Mr. Alien!

15:28.660 --> 15:29.720
Hmph.

15:29.720 --> 15:32.360
And it was getting good, too.

15:32.360 --> 15:33.860
You senseless boy!

15:33.860 --> 15:35.400
I'm not a boy!

15:35.400 --> 15:38.000
Where do you think
you've got your eyes?

15:38.000 --> 15:39.500
Here and...

15:39.500 --> 15:40.530
...here!

15:40.530 --> 15:42.000
Damn you...

15:42.000 --> 15:45.970
It makes me sick to think a
guy like you is a man like me!

15:45.970 --> 15:47.310
Get outta here!

15:47.310 --> 15:49.180
What if I said I don't want to?

15:49.180 --> 15:51.300
I'll throw you out by force!

15:52.650 --> 15:53.810
Interesting.

16:04.160 --> 16:05.590
C-Cheater...

16:05.590 --> 16:06.860
Huh?

16:06.860 --> 16:08.490
I can't hear you well.

16:09.500 --> 16:13.570
Besides, those are your rules, right?

16:13.570 --> 16:15.300
They're not my rules.

16:16.300 --> 16:19.110
I don't know who got it into your head,

16:19.110 --> 16:22.510
but don't talk about yourself
using someone else's words!

16:28.650 --> 16:29.950
A fight?

16:29.950 --> 16:31.850
Please! Someone, help!

16:31.850 --> 16:33.380
Mr. Alien's gonna die!

16:34.520 --> 16:35.620
Leave them alone.

16:35.620 --> 16:40.030
Men are creatures that learn
various things physically, after all.

16:41.000 --> 16:42.730
Isn't that right?

16:42.730 --> 16:43.720
Aye aye.

16:44.970 --> 16:50.060
Nothing's sillier than a know-it-all
playing on another guy's field.

16:51.440 --> 16:55.510
Even if he pretends,
the disguise'll quickly fall apart.

16:55.510 --> 16:57.540
Just like you!

16:57.540 --> 16:58.640
Shut up!

17:02.750 --> 17:05.390
Men, who really are strong,

17:05.390 --> 17:08.120
choose their own words to fight with.

17:08.120 --> 17:10.020
Compared to a million proverbs...

17:10.020 --> 17:11.090
Just...

17:11.090 --> 17:12.360
one word...

17:12.360 --> 17:14.260
from your heart...

17:14.260 --> 17:16.200
can prove victorious!

17:19.330 --> 17:20.490
Stop it!

17:24.610 --> 17:25.870
Mr. Alien!

17:27.340 --> 17:29.410
Damn it, you brat!

17:29.410 --> 17:30.740
Let go!

17:34.480 --> 17:35.620
Mr. Alien!

17:35.620 --> 17:37.950
Are you all right, Mr. Alien?

17:37.950 --> 17:39.210
Out of the way!

17:41.220 --> 17:42.920
You little brat!

17:44.760 --> 17:46.450
I'll kill you right here!

17:48.560 --> 17:49.890
The game's over.

17:52.200 --> 17:53.330
Yeah, yeah.

17:57.840 --> 17:58.870
Mr. Alien!

17:58.870 --> 18:01.380
Hang on, Mr. Alien!

18:01.380 --> 18:03.180
Missie.

18:03.180 --> 18:05.650
Tell him when he wakes up

18:05.650 --> 18:09.210
to challenge me with his own
words the next time I see him.

18:20.830 --> 18:21.830
Oh, brother.

18:21.830 --> 18:23.560
Looks like I'm the one they hate.

18:25.800 --> 18:27.290
Utan, we're going home.

18:29.300 --> 18:30.670
Mr. Alien.

18:36.940 --> 18:39.150
Rabat's ship is taking off!

18:39.150 --> 18:41.180
Parfet, engines to full!

18:41.180 --> 18:43.050
We'll do it the pirate way.

18:47.890 --> 18:50.220
This is just amazing!

18:50.220 --> 18:53.260
We're going at
five times normal output!

18:53.260 --> 18:54.290
I feel it coming...

18:54.290 --> 18:55.960
Oh yeah, it's coming!

18:55.960 --> 18:57.330
You won't get away.

18:57.330 --> 18:59.060
I'll strip you of everything.

19:02.040 --> 19:05.470
That Paksis Pragma sticks in my mind.

19:18.090 --> 19:19.580
What? What's wrong?

19:26.260 --> 19:28.530
Hey, engine room, what're you doing?

19:28.530 --> 19:29.500
He'll get away!

19:30.960 --> 19:34.900
I don't know why, but that
system seems to have overloaded!

19:34.900 --> 19:38.170
I'm sure it was faulty!
Someone file a complaint!

19:39.240 --> 19:40.610
He got us.

19:40.610 --> 19:43.270
See you, ladies!

20:03.200 --> 20:07.000
At times like this,
it's better to leave men alone.

20:17.950 --> 20:20.010
Don't worry about it.

20:20.010 --> 20:22.410
Everything he said was just quibbles.

20:23.480 --> 20:25.790
Just a con artist's game.

20:25.790 --> 20:28.190
No, I was taking him lightly.

20:29.290 --> 20:31.490
Even if he was a cheater,

20:31.490 --> 20:35.160
if he'd been serious, I'd be long dead.

20:35.160 --> 20:36.390
I hate to admit it...

20:37.460 --> 20:39.800
but I don't have words to call my own.

20:40.900 --> 20:42.960
I only have others' words to say.

20:46.240 --> 20:49.040
When I get up on my own stage,

20:49.040 --> 20:51.880
I wonder what kind of
lines will come out of me?

20:53.950 --> 20:56.120
I'm looking forward to it,

20:56.120 --> 20:58.390
but it's a chilling thought.

20:58.390 --> 21:01.320
I keep thinking it'll just be a comedy.

21:02.460 --> 21:05.790
No matter how pitiful the lines are...

21:05.790 --> 21:09.030
if they're genuine and you're
screaming them from your heart...

21:09.030 --> 21:10.890
nobody will laugh at you.

21:11.870 --> 21:13.470
At least...

21:13.470 --> 21:14.800
I won't.

21:32.150 --> 21:37.790
Hey, you realized what the words,

21:37.790 --> 21:43.300
I really wanted to hear are, right?

21:43.300 --> 21:49.540
I was looking at your profile as
you talked about the distant future.

21:49.540 --> 21:59.850
Take me with you to the depths of dreams.

21:59.850 --> 22:02.380
Hey, with all of my body.

22:02.380 --> 22:14.160
A pistol named love shoots
through the center of my chest.

22:14.160 --> 22:25.770
Negotiations and common
sense hold no meaning at all.

22:25.770 --> 22:37.580
Pull the trigger named love and
shoot through my frozen heart.

22:37.580 --> 22:51.450
Pour in your love
to the tips of my fingers.
